<tier type="longtitle" id="frnt-lt">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8093b6db-d57c-4b74-8fa4-d668497a9cad"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="frnt-lt"></attrib></parentattributes>

<block><txt break.before="1">An Act to enable the proclamation of a catchment
area for Googong Dam and the regulation of activities within that area; to
provide compensation for certain persons injuriously affected by the
regulations; and for purposes connected therewith.</txt></block></tier>
</content>


<content type="body">

<level type="clause" id="sec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5b84e683-7b18-497a-b580-d423b7f43fac"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_cc8f3dee-ba42-4e53-9eb0-b551af50deb7"
id="sec.1-he"><b>Name of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act may be cited as the <legref
refid="act-1975-004" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Googong Dam Catchment Area Act
1975</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_591f7eb2-a6ce-47bf-bfc5-4357c1b658d4"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_f8a360c5-4aa9-40df-9e0a-ecb8d4e9a7ac"
id="sec.2-he"><b>Act binds Crown</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act binds the Crown.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_da8018a1-1bec-4c2d-97d7-e03aee320040"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_fbd42bef-c028-4e6d-9766-ba9b116d7bc7"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act, except in so far as the context or
subject-matter otherwise indicates or requires:</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_bef0f37f-80bd-4dbf-a289-705f11759c08"
id="def.catchmentarea"><b><i>catchment area</i></b></defterm> means lands in
respect of which a proclamation made under section 4 (1) is in
force.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_d3f52dfe-af6f-43a6-bbb4-6b3132560bd2"
id="def.GoogongDamArea"><b><i>Googong Dam Area</i></b></defterm> has the
meaning ascribed thereto in the <legref jurisd="CTH" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Canberra Water Supply (Googong Dam)
Act 1974</i></name></legref> of the Parliament of the Commonwealth, as amended
from time to time.</txt></block></deflist>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_367f4ec8-5d18-4e6b-9cd9-d9be39424996"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_aa218712-00e4-417f-98bf-8a4b7344f6c5"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Catchment area</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2eb15d9b-3290-4900-9d9b-8eef270ccfd6"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Governor may by proclamation published in the
Gazette:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_a553b940-61c9-42a6-a5df-3a947856687f" id="sec.4-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">declare any lands, whether including the whole or
any part of the Googong Dam Area, to be a catchment area for the Googong Dam
Area,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_0b799128-91a9-4681-9847-e96a734f0e26" id="sec.4-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">amend the boundaries of the catchment area
declared under paragraph (a), or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_8e818d11-02d4-470b-b40d-c7620a456bb9" id="sec.4-ssec.1-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">revoke a proclamation made under paragraph (a) or
(b).</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5437da94-7da5-4f5f-a7c9-2d65d9ea3931"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A proclamation made under subsection (1) may
define the catchment area:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_3a3238bd-67a3-4f59-9f25-9bf6b3b89a74" id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">in metes and bounds,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_e197734c-d0d0-4d6a-8657-a5bf272380b3" id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">by reference to a plan deposited at the office of
the Minister, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_370dc0f1-0d97-4d44-b422-ade966fd0ced" id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">partly in metes and bounds and partly by
reference to a plan deposited at the office of the
Minister.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_17c8edd7-04b4-4f7f-96fb-849da95e9f37"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_2c331c79-3554-4fc3-9696-a2476cb9c10e"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Regulations</b></heading></head>

<pre type="auto-inserted">

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6f724390-ab84-41d3-99aa-355f1eda4fbd"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Governor may make regulations not
inconsistent with this Act for or with respect to:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_bcfbe20e-0d40-4527-b09c-95145fb837d1" id="sec.5-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the marking of the boundaries of the catchment
area,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c0487f23-bf01-4e52-a4d7-b90d69136126" id="sec.5-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the inspection of land within and buildings upon
the catchment area,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_215aa0c8-683e-4116-bdd7-7ed6a5cf3625" id="sec.5-ssec.1-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the regulation or the prohibition within the
catchment area of:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_6d876edc-030a-4885-9f02-1a37614c1a62"
id="sec.5-ssec.1-para1.c-para2.i">
<no>(i)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">burials,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_3c90d057-0b9b-4390-b7ae-dbc03fc6eb36"
id="sec.5-ssec.1-para1.c-para2.ii">
<no>(ii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the keeping of animals,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_317e6a16-433e-454b-ab80-882311238e39"
id="sec.5-ssec.1-para1.c-para2.iii">
<no>(iii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">shooting,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c13fe0fc-e7c6-4842-88bf-5cff3a8af6c1"
id="sec.5-ssec.1-para1.c-para2.iv">
<no>(iv)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">camping, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_5ec3e201-c55e-48cd-9199-8a651f9e1ea1"
id="sec.5-ssec.1-para1.c-para2.v">
<no>(v)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the depositing of
litter,</txt></block></li></list>
</block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_dd43f4d6-7f70-4b36-873a-8e74f94c71a5" id="sec.5-ssec.1-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the establishment of and the regulation of
activities in recreational areas within the catchment
area,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_022fb539-4b91-469d-b543-f7a0977e8909" id="sec.5-ssec.1-para1.e">
<no>(e)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the establishment and regulation of
workers&#8217; camps within the catchment area,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_3f837260-4d96-4c37-8d21-984c7504fa00" id="sec.5-ssec.1-para1.f">
<no>(f)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the prevention of the destruction of trees,
shrubs, herbage or other vegetative cover and the preservation or provision of
arboreal cover within the catchment area, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_30f0793c-4d67-4eaf-9cb9-9a16db5a2784" id="sec.5-ssec.1-para1.g">
<no>(g)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any matter which is necessary or convenient to be
prescribed for carrying out or giving effect to this
Act.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>
</pre>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_7cd02697-e24b-4d5b-92a6-5f2c03e47347"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Regulations may be made so as to apply
differently according to such factors as may be specified in the
regulations.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1a3b36b1-9d56-424e-b470-fb5e2f88a557"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A regulation may be made so as to authorise any
matter or thing to be from time to time determined, applied or regulated by
any person or body specified in the regulation.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_4333b178-62a4-4570-b96f-b5d40491aca7"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A regulation may impose a penalty not exceeding 2
penalty units for an offence against the regulation.</txt></block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 5:</b> Am 1992 No 112,
Sch 1; 2000 No 53, Sch 3.9.</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2fc966c4-6518-46c9-b56c-7b49c24e4e1e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_98a07020-c6f1-4358-9f87-e51bf312276f"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Compensation</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_091ffcf2-0da4-4272-ab7e-a302a192f9f0"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A person who has an estate or interest in, or a
right or interest in respect of, any land within the catchment area on the
date on which a proclamation is made under section 4 (1) which is injuriously
affected by a regulation made under this Act is entitled to claim compensation
from the Minister in respect of the damage suffered by
him.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1fd34e4c-f150-4de9-a192-7727996cd280"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Section 581 of the <legref refid="act-1919-041"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Local
Government Act 1919</i></name></legref> applies to and in respect of a claim
for compensation made under subsection (1) in the same way as it applies to a
claim for compensation made under the <legref refid="act-1919-041"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Local
Government Act 1919</i></name></legref>, and in so applying that section, a
reference to the council shall be read and construed as a reference to the
Minister.</txt></block></tier>
</level>
</content>


